	(text "Based on old schematic in dutch magazine, found image online and did this PCB in order to test it out.\nWhen using a bicolour LED with green and red colour it should flash orange when most I/O operations\nare taking place, added a switch that can be used to disable it according to discussion online."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
